                                                "sense_id": "fdb38887-8ce1-30c4-90f8-3be0d78ca414",
                                                "text": "Rather than fostering unity, he becomes divisive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bd7eebb0-f0e7-448d-9b48-16834db408fd",
                                                "sense_id": "fdb38887-8ce1-30c4-90f8-3be0d78ca414",
                                                "text": "[W]hat a change has introduced itself everywhere into human affairs! [...] all is grown acrid, divisive, threatening dissolution; [...]"
